From 497734121924b59c43a4c9dab309ba6d296822ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Atlas <atlas@localhost>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:01:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Bedrock logos-blockchain 3926a532 -> 6b33abb3 (master
 2026-10-23); re-enable pending-tx expiry

- drop integration_tests from the workspace (it needs the testing framework the bump breaks)
- stale_refund_slots 0 -> 30 (the zone-sdk default): with 0, an inscription underfunded by a
  storage-gas-price step at an epoch boundary (InsufficientBalance) is never expired or
  re-funded, so every later inscription is InvalidParent and finality stops for good

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
